ng software (e.g., NCS Expert, INPA) to check module presence.\n\nLet me know if you need help identifying or upgrading your system!"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"gizmo_id":"g-67ad6a7ac1d481918ba2a98c8a51a6d8","message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"gpt-4o","parent_id":"cd5d3390-1133-4d6d-9148-022823bbea36","request_id":"91d39ee43dce0003-SJC","timestamp_":"absolute","model_switcher_deny":[]},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"cd5d3390-1133-4d6d-9148-022823bbea36","children":["77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a"]},"77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a":{"id":"77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a","message":{"id":"77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a","author":{"role":"user","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1741450464.043,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["## Instructions\n**Tone instruction:**\nPlease ignore all previous tone instructions. From now on, I want you to respond only in Formal tone (toneCode: formal).\n**Writing-Style instruction:**\nPlease ignore all previous writing-style instructions. From now on, I want you to respond only in Analytical writing style (writingStyleCode: analytical).\nPLEASE FOLLOW ALL THE ABOVE INSTRUCTIONS, AND DO NOT REPEAT OR TYPE ANY GENERAL CONFIRMATION OR A CONFIRMATION ABOUT ANY OF THE ABOVE INSTRUCTIONS IN YOUR RESPONSE\n## End Instructions\n\nif it helps i only have 4 speakers"]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":null,"weight":1,"metadata":{"serialization_metadata":{"custom_symbol_offsets":[]},"request_id":"91d3a017ee610003-ORD","message_source":null,"timestamp_":"absolute","message_type":null},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"44de45ec-d726-4cdf-9fef-5b5c79b147ad","children":["6fdb6d41-42e3-4f21-a2ce-8b9107550cda"]},"6fdb6d41-42e3-4f21-a2ce-8b9107550cda":{"id":"6fdb6d41-42e3-4f21-a2ce-8b9107550cda","message":{"id":"6fdb6d41-42e3-4f21-a2ce-8b9107550cda","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1741450465.139525,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"text","parts":["Given that your 2010 BMW E90 335i has only four speakers, it is highly likely that your vehicle is equipped with the **Base Stereo System**, which does not include an external amplifier. This is because the Base Stereo System typically consists of four or six speakers, all powered directly by the head unit, without the need for an external amplifier. \n\nFor further verification, you can:\n1. **Check for an amplifier in the trunk** – The HiFi and Logic 7/Harman Kardon systems include an amplifier located on the left side of the trunk, behind the carpeted panel. If there is no amplifier present, this confirms the Base Stereo System.\n2. **Decode your VIN** – By entering your Vehicle Identification Number (VIN) into an online BMW VIN decoder, you can retrieve the factory-installed options, including the audio system.\n3. **Check the head unit wiring** – If your head unit directly powers the speakers without separate low-level signal wiring to an amplifier, it confirms the absence of an external amplifier.\n\nIf you are considering upgrading your audio system, options include retrofitting a HiFi or aftermarket amplifier, adding additional speakers, or replacing the head unit with one that offers better sound processing capabilities."]},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":true,"weight":1,"metadata":{"finish_details":{"type":"stop","stop_tokens":[200002]},"is_complete":true,"citations":[],"content_references":[],"gizmo_id":"g-67ad6a7ac1d481918ba2a98c8a51a6d8","message_type":null,"model_slug":"gpt-4o","default_model_slug":"gpt-4o","parent_id":"77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a","request_id":"91d3a017ee610003-ORD","timestamp_":"absolute","model_switcher_deny":[]},"recipient":"all","channel":null},"parent":"77c85ba0-e368-4b0f-8034-d7990ccda24a